  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Gender-Responsive and Inclusive Social Protection Symposium 2026 (FALSOC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary objective of the symposium is to?influence and inform greater investment in, and adoption of, gender-responsive approaches to social protection policy and practice.  

Overall objective of the assignment: The FCDO Social Protection Team are seeking expert technical support to ensure the success and impact of the symposium, alongside a mechanism that would enable the FCDO to support the participation of priority attendees from partner governments in sub-Saharan Africa and MENA, civil society organisations and FCDO-funded flagship research programmes.</narrative>
  </description>
